    "body": "For better or worse, this isn't what browser implement. `<meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"...\">` is what we parse out in https://code.google.com/p/chromium/codesearch#chromium/src/out/Debug/gen/blink/core/HTMLMetaElement.cpp&rcl=1462274274&l=535, for instance.\n",
